# LF in every checkout, Windows included: the PTX is embedded byte for byte (include_str!) and checked against
# hashes, and the shell scripts CI runs under Git Bash must not gain carriage returns
* text=auto eol=lf
# the kernel and its build records, embedded or hashed byte for byte
ptx/*.ptx binary
ptx/*.txt binary
ptx/sources.sha256 binary
# zarr chunks (extensionless), .npy arrays and the reference .afv files the tests compare byte for byte
tests/fixtures/** -text
# the strips kernels' PTX and build records, embedded or hashed byte for byte
ptx/strips*.ptx binary
